00:01:08.694 --> 00:01:13.407
Everyone embarks on a journey
dreaming of the Sea of Stars.

00:01:14.533 --> 00:01:17.286
Chasing the memories
of one's dreams endlessly.

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:20.747
While still on the road...

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:27.671
One's dream eventually
succumbs to an eternal sleep.

00:01:29.464 --> 00:01:32.634
Lives end, lives begin.

00:01:33.594 --> 00:01:37.306
The train runs through
this endless flow.

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:41.101
It carries on its
infinite tracks...

00:01:41.602 --> 00:01:44.646
The hopes, the ambitions
and youth of all humanity.

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:49.276
And for one youth,
the train runs again today.

00:02:01.079 --> 00:02:03.290
And now the whistle signals...

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:06.168
The journey's beginning
for that young man.

