01:02:49.557 --> 01:02:50.767
Planet Heavy Melder

01:02:50.767 --> 01:02:51.184
All travellers pass through here
at least once. Planet Heavy Melder

01:02:51.184 --> 01:02:54.020
All travellers pass through
here at least once.

01:02:55.021 --> 01:02:58.275
The frontier of both
freedom and lawlessness.

01:03:00.443 --> 01:03:03.989
Many people come here
with great dreams.

01:03:04.447 --> 01:03:06.866
Some become the ashes
of this planet...

01:03:07.409 --> 01:03:07.909
While others keep
their dreams intact,

01:03:07.909 --> 01:03:07.951
While others keep their
dreams intact, Trader's Fork

01:03:07.951 --> 01:03:07.993
While others keep their
dreams intact, Trader's Fork

01:03:07.993 --> 01:03:08.034
While others keep their
dreams intact, Trader's Fork

01:03:08.034 --> 01:03:08.076
While others keep their
dreams intact, Trader's Fork

01:03:08.076 --> 01:03:08.118
While others keep their
dreams intact, Trader's Fork

01:03:08.118 --> 01:03:08.159
While others keep their
dreams intact, Trader's Fork

01:03:08.159 --> 01:03:10.453
While others keep their
dreams intact, Trader's Fork

01:03:10.453 --> 01:03:12.205
and leave for the ends of the
unknown universe. Trader's Fork

01:03:12.205 --> 01:03:13.873
and leave for the ends of
the unknown universe.

01:03:14.666 --> 01:03:18.378
This is the planet Heavy Melder.

01:03:25.593 --> 01:03:28.096
Please don't let anything
happen to Tetsuro...

01:04:01.171 --> 01:04:02.047
Maetel!

01:04:04.632 --> 01:04:06.926
If you don't mind,
I'd like to take a look around.

01:04:07.510 --> 01:04:11.014
Maybe see if anyone knows
about the Time Castle.

01:04:11.806 --> 01:04:12.807
Be careful.

01:04:12.807 --> 01:04:13.475
OK.

01:04:13.475 --> 01:04:14.684
Good.

01:05:06.736 --> 01:05:12.617
What are you saying you want

01:05:12.617 --> 01:05:17.247
Is it me? Or love more refined?

01:05:18.706 --> 01:05:24.629
Even birds resting their wings

01:05:24.629 --> 01:05:30.301
Noisily clamor "want me"

01:05:30.593 --> 01:05:48.319
Like a child holding his
broken toybox and bawling

01:05:48.736 --> 01:05:54.033
What good will come of that?

01:05:57.912 --> 01:06:03.668
What are you saying you want

01:06:03.918 --> 01:06:09.215
Is it me, oris it love?

01:06:09.966 --> 01:06:15.972
Don't be kind to this worn-out heart

01:06:15.972 --> 01:06:21.478
Don't let yourself be

01:06:21.769 --> 01:06:39.746
Everyone recites a folktale or two
they seem to treasure, but...

01:06:40.288 --> 01:06:46.085
What good will come of that?

01:07:10.026 --> 01:07:11.444
Hello, youngster.

01:07:11.444 --> 01:07:11.986
Huh?

01:07:13.363 --> 01:07:15.323
First time I've seen you here.

01:07:15.573 --> 01:07:17.242
Why are they all crying?

01:07:17.867 --> 01:07:19.702
It's because of that song.

01:07:20.328 --> 01:07:25.833
It reminds them of their youth,
of days that'll never come again.

01:07:26.334 --> 01:07:28.836
For those who've come
to the end of their journey...

01:07:28.836 --> 01:07:31.714
It's a hard thing for
them to remember.

01:07:35.218 --> 01:07:36.719
What'll it be?

01:07:37.303 --> 01:07:37.887
Milk.

01:07:40.223 --> 01:07:41.891
Did he just say milk?

01:07:42.517 --> 01:07:44.185
That's what he said!

01:07:44.477 --> 01:07:46.688
Bet he misses
his mother's milk!

01:07:51.776 --> 01:07:55.196
If I pour,
will you buy me a round?

01:07:58.074 --> 01:08:00.868
Guess you must really know
a lot about this place.

01:08:02.370 --> 01:08:04.622
Yeah, they call me
the living encyclopedia.

01:08:05.039 --> 01:08:08.585
Then can you tell me when Count
Mecha's Time Castle will appear?

01:08:29.397 --> 01:08:31.566
What kind of business have
you got with Count Mecha?

01:08:32.567 --> 01:08:33.192
I'm gonna kill him.

01:08:33.484 --> 01:08:34.152
Fool!

01:08:34.485 --> 01:08:36.237
You're no match for him.

01:08:38.323 --> 01:08:40.491
| won't know until I try!

01:08:40.950 --> 01:08:43.911
Count Mecha killed my mother.

01:08:44.704 --> 01:08:45.622
For her sake, I'm gonna--

01:08:45.955 --> 01:08:49.667
No, not just for her, but for
every kid who's mother he killed!

01:08:50.877 --> 01:08:54.255
If only for those orphaned kids,
somehow I've gotta--

01:08:54.464 --> 01:08:55.298
All right.

01:08:55.548 --> 01:08:57.842
You'll find what you want
at Mount Gun Frontier.

01:08:58.259 --> 01:08:59.385
"Mount Gun Frontier?"

01:08:59.802 --> 01:09:02.055
It's about ten kilometers
from here to the south.

01:09:02.055 --> 01:09:04.932
There's an eccentric who lives
at the base of the mountain.

01:09:05.224 --> 01:09:09.520
If anyone knows where that
Time Castle will be next, it's him.

01:09:13.983 --> 01:09:14.692
Thank you!

01:09:20.323 --> 01:09:22.241
Where's that punk, geezer!

01:09:22.241 --> 01:09:24.035
What did you tell him?

01:09:24.035 --> 01:09:25.536
I-I didn't say a thing!

01:10:15.420 --> 01:10:17.964
What a piece of junk!

01:10:58.004 --> 01:11:03.134
...he'll be wearing the hat
| made for him, just like yours.

01:11:03.134 --> 01:11:04.343
Y-You must be--

01:11:04.761 --> 01:11:06.554
Where did you get that hat?

01:11:06.929 --> 01:11:08.890
| got it from your mother.

01:11:09.223 --> 01:11:11.100
You know my mother?

01:11:11.601 --> 01:11:13.853
She helped me when
| was in danger.

01:11:16.022 --> 01:11:17.732
She gave me this, too.

01:11:18.483 --> 01:11:20.234
My mother, how was she?

01:11:20.693 --> 01:11:22.820
She really wants to see you.

01:11:23.654 --> 01:11:25.907
| gave all of my good-byes
when I set out for space...

01:11:26.282 --> 01:11:27.116
Well, come inside.

01:11:28.201 --> 01:11:29.994
I'm sure you've come for a reason.

01:11:41.923 --> 01:11:44.342
| see, so that's why you've
come for this visit.

01:11:48.304 --> 01:11:51.933
Please tell me, when will
Count Mecha come here next?

01:11:53.643 --> 01:11:56.771
Guess you and I are
thinking the same thing...

01:11:57.522 --> 01:11:58.397
We are?

01:11:59.023 --> 01:12:00.107
That's right.

01:12:01.150 --> 01:12:05.988
Long ago he, too, was a
red-blooded man with a warm heart.

01:12:06.823 --> 01:12:09.033
But once he acquired
his Mechanized body...

01:12:09.033 --> 01:12:12.078
Humans became something
he felt he could destroy.

01:12:12.578 --> 01:12:15.456
| cannot forgive his cruelty...

01:12:18.417 --> 01:12:19.377
B-But it's...

01:12:20.586 --> 01:12:21.754
It's too late.

01:12:22.880 --> 01:12:23.589
Too late?

01:12:23.589 --> 01:12:24.465
Why?

01:12:25.049 --> 01:12:26.259
Too late for what?

01:12:27.301 --> 01:12:31.472
Years of wandering have left me
with an incurable galactic disease.

01:12:32.932 --> 01:12:35.518
Don't worry,
I'm not dead yet!

01:12:37.019 --> 01:12:38.521
Not for a little while, anyway...

01:12:39.313 --> 01:12:40.439
That's right, you can't die!

01:12:40.439 --> 01:12:42.733
Emeraldas is looking for you.

01:12:44.318 --> 01:12:46.404
You've met Emeraldas?

01:12:46.863 --> 01:12:47.405
Yes.

01:12:47.822 --> 01:12:50.116
She's the one who
told me about the Time Castle.

01:12:52.034 --> 01:12:53.828
At midnight tonight...

01:12:54.495 --> 01:12:57.915
He ought to appear on
the other side of Mount Gun Frontier.

01:13:01.377 --> 01:13:03.087
Mount Gun Frontier at midnight.

01:13:04.046 --> 01:13:06.757
| was hoping to have
killed Count Mecha...

01:13:06.757 --> 01:13:08.926
Before this sickness
caught up with me...

01:13:10.970 --> 01:13:12.555
Tetsuro, I have one favor to ask.

01:13:12.972 --> 01:13:14.056
What is it?

01:13:14.557 --> 01:13:15.433
Listen well...

01:13:15.433 --> 01:13:17.768
when I lie down,
pull down on that lever.

01:13:19.562 --> 01:13:21.314
What happens when I pull it?

01:13:22.356 --> 01:13:23.524
Then I'll...

01:13:24.275 --> 01:13:26.027
go some place else.

01:13:29.071 --> 01:13:30.323
Pay attention, Tetsuro.

01:13:30.907 --> 01:13:33.367
Shoot Count Mecha in the head.

01:13:33.701 --> 01:13:38.456
As long as their head is intact,
Mechanized people can still--

01:13:40.583 --> 01:13:41.500
Hang on!

01:13:41.792 --> 01:13:42.919
Please, hang on!

01:13:44.378 --> 01:13:47.590
I'll soon become one
with a machine myself.

01:13:48.257 --> 01:13:54.388
I'll become the soul of my
best friend's ship, the Arcadia...

01:13:54.388 --> 01:13:56.724
and wander Sea of Stars.

01:13:56.724 --> 01:13:58.684
Tetsuro, the lever!

01:13:59.727 --> 01:14:00.686
| can't...

01:14:01.520 --> 01:14:02.813
| can't do it!

01:14:04.273 --> 01:14:07.234
Do it, so that I may
stand once more...

01:14:07.234 --> 01:14:08.194
Pull it now!

01:14:08.194 --> 01:14:09.278
Please, Tetsuro!

01:14:12.239 --> 01:14:13.449
There are still...

01:14:13.449 --> 01:14:17.703
so many things
that I want to do...

01:15:11.966 --> 01:15:14.343
Being human means
you also have to die...

01:15:15.845 --> 01:15:18.764
Whether you've lived out
your dreams or not.

01:15:30.443 --> 01:15:32.945
You're Count Mecha's men,
aren't you!

01:15:48.961 --> 01:15:50.671
Go home, kid.

01:15:50.671 --> 01:15:53.257
Get some more milk
from your mama's teat.

01:16:38.594 --> 01:16:40.096
Give me back my gun.

01:16:40.638 --> 01:16:42.014
It's right here!

01:16:51.107 --> 01:16:52.024
Give it back!

01:16:53.025 --> 01:16:54.735
It's mine now!

01:16:58.239 --> 01:16:59.365
Give it back!

01:17:00.825 --> 01:17:02.451
Damn you!

01:17:03.828 --> 01:17:05.579
It's my gun--

01:17:08.249 --> 01:17:09.708
Somebody help!

01:17:12.378 --> 01:17:13.254
It's you...

01:17:15.214 --> 01:17:16.674
Captain Harlock!

01:17:22.805 --> 01:17:24.932
Barkeep, I need a milk.

01:17:35.484 --> 01:17:36.735
Bottom's up!

01:17:36.735 --> 01:17:38.154
Milk will make me rust!

01:17:38.154 --> 01:17:39.905
Give me a break, please!

01:17:53.627 --> 01:17:55.379
So there's nothing
| can say to stop you?

01:17:55.671 --> 01:17:56.213
Yes.

01:17:58.215 --> 01:18:00.885
Why did you
save me back there?

01:18:01.427 --> 01:18:04.430
You built my best friend's grave,
so I owed you a favor.

01:18:04.972 --> 01:18:05.347
What?

01:18:05.723 --> 01:18:08.976
Then that "best friend" he
talked about was you?

01:18:20.863 --> 01:18:22.615
It's been a long time, Harlock.

01:18:23.240 --> 01:18:23.991
Indeed.

01:18:25.910 --> 01:18:29.038
Emeraldas, about the man
you were looking for--

01:18:30.080 --> 01:18:31.749
Has something happened
to Tochiro?

01:18:33.042 --> 01:18:35.127
He's on this planet, isn't he!

01:18:35.711 --> 01:18:37.630
Where is he, Harlock?

01:18:41.091 --> 01:18:41.926
He's dead.

01:19:33.560 --> 01:19:34.311
That's it...

01:19:34.979 --> 01:19:35.854
the Time Castle!

01:19:35.854 --> 01:19:38.816
Time Castle

01:22:20.519 --> 01:22:21.603
Mother...

01:22:50.716 --> 01:22:53.010
So you were in with
Count Mecha all along!

01:22:53.010 --> 01:22:54.261
And what if she was?

01:22:56.096 --> 01:22:57.389
Who the hell are you!

01:22:57.681 --> 01:22:58.849
I'm Hoshino Tetsuro.

01:22:58.849 --> 01:23:01.602
You killed my mother,
and I've come to avenge her!

01:23:01.852 --> 01:23:02.936
"Avenge?”

01:23:03.353 --> 01:23:05.856
Don't tell me,
you're here to kill me!

01:23:06.231 --> 01:23:06.815
Correct!

01:23:26.627 --> 01:23:28.086
What did I tell you?

01:23:28.086 --> 01:23:29.546
Shoot before you get shot yourself!

01:23:30.714 --> 01:23:31.882
Antares!

01:23:32.341 --> 01:23:33.842
Mind if I help?

01:23:43.685 --> 01:23:44.937
Thank you, Antares.

01:23:44.937 --> 01:23:45.979
No need to thank me!

01:23:49.066 --> 01:23:49.858
I'm also here to avenge...

01:23:49.858 --> 01:23:53.946
The tens of thousands
of orphans he's made!

01:24:02.412 --> 01:24:02.913
Stop!

01:24:02.913 --> 01:24:03.789
Tetsuro!

01:24:05.916 --> 01:24:07.793
Go, I'll take care of the rest.

01:24:25.978 --> 01:24:26.853
Slop!

01:24:39.032 --> 01:24:43.412
W-Wait, look what
you've done to me!

01:24:43.412 --> 01:24:44.580
| can't fight any more,
not like this.

01:24:44.997 --> 01:24:47.457
Please don't make me
suffer any further...

01:24:53.005 --> 01:24:53.755
Antares.

01:25:00.554 --> 01:25:01.263
Damn you!

01:25:04.641 --> 01:25:06.351
Leave this to me...

01:25:10.480 --> 01:25:11.106
Antares!

01:25:11.565 --> 01:25:12.774
Get out of here!

01:25:12.774 --> 01:25:15.402
I've still got all those
live bullets in my body!

01:25:15.944 --> 01:25:17.696
Ryuzu, move time forward.

01:25:22.034 --> 01:25:22.951
Ryuzu, what's wrong?

01:25:23.285 --> 01:25:24.661
Hurry, move time forward!

01:25:35.839 --> 01:25:36.340
Ryuzu?

01:25:36.798 --> 01:25:37.591
What's wrong, Ryuzu?

01:25:38.008 --> 01:25:38.800
Ryuzu!

01:25:41.553 --> 01:25:45.015
It looks like your last friend
has betrayed you, Count Mecha.

01:25:45.307 --> 01:25:48.185
This is your punishment
for killing innocent humans!

01:25:51.938 --> 01:25:54.399
Tetsuro, it's Maetel.

01:25:54.608 --> 01:25:56.777
Don't trust Maetel!

01:26:24.012 --> 01:26:26.223
Tetsuro, get out of here.

01:26:27.265 --> 01:26:29.726
The Time Castle will soon fall.

01:26:30.185 --> 01:26:32.396
But, why are you saving me?

01:26:34.022 --> 01:26:35.649
When I first saw you...

01:26:35.941 --> 01:26:38.318
| was reminded of
my own lost past.

01:26:39.027 --> 01:26:41.238
| remembered my youth.

01:26:41.238 --> 01:26:47.119
Back then I was made of
warm flesh, just like you.

01:26:47.119 --> 01:26:52.624
But I chose a Mechanized body,
just to please the Count...

01:26:52.624 --> 01:26:56.920
And after countless modifications,
| ceased to be myself any more.

01:26:59.381 --> 01:27:02.384
| became a witch
who controls time.

01:27:02.384 --> 01:27:07.180
There was one thing in me
he couldn't control, however...

01:27:08.014 --> 01:27:11.268
And that was the spirit
of a warm-blooded human.

01:27:14.521 --> 01:27:15.313
Hurry!

01:27:15.313 --> 01:27:16.523
Hurry, get out of here!

01:27:17.983 --> 01:27:19.276
But your body is rusting!

01:27:19.901 --> 01:27:21.445
It's turning to rust...

01:27:26.324 --> 01:27:27.826
Goodbye, Ryuzu!

01:27:55.103 --> 01:27:56.730
"Don't shoot the Count.”

01:27:57.439 --> 01:28:00.984
That's what I was crying
to you in my heart.

01:28:04.112 --> 01:28:08.992
But this is for the best.
I'm actually glad...

01:29:16.977 --> 01:29:17.853
Mother...

01:30:22.584 --> 01:30:26.504
With this,
your vengeance is over.

01:30:27.255 --> 01:30:27.923
Tetsuro.

01:30:32.177 --> 01:30:34.638
Captain Harlock, that isn't true.

01:30:35.889 --> 01:30:39.100
As I look at Count Mecha
and other Mechanized people...

01:30:39.100 --> 01:30:41.394
| find that eternal life
isn't always happiness.

01:30:42.062 --> 01:30:45.482
It's because life is limited
that people try hard to live.

01:30:45.482 --> 01:30:47.817
To feel for others,
and be kind to one another.

01:30:48.151 --> 01:30:49.486
| realize now...

01:30:49.945 --> 01:30:53.198
That Mechanized bodies must
be removed from the universe.

01:30:54.199 --> 01:30:55.784
I've realized that living forever...

01:30:55.784 --> 01:31:01.247
isn't a good enough reason
to get a mechanical body!

01:31:04.084 --> 01:31:09.422
That's why I'm going to that planet in
the Andromeda galaxy...

01:31:09.422 --> 01:31:11.466
so that I can destroy it!

01:31:27.524 --> 01:31:29.776
| didn't feel this way
when I started out...

01:31:31.486 --> 01:31:35.323
Maetel, thanks for
getting me on the 999.

01:31:35.323 --> 01:31:37.492
I'm grateful to you.

01:31:55.760 --> 01:31:56.386
They made it!

01:31:57.387 --> 01:31:58.179
Maetel!

01:33:23.473 --> 01:33:24.974
Maetel, you wanted to see me?

01:33:25.308 --> 01:33:26.684
Please, sit down.

01:33:37.821 --> 01:33:39.114
Congratulations, Tetsuro.

01:33:39.614 --> 01:33:42.117
You've successfully
avenged your mother.

01:33:47.288 --> 01:33:48.206
Thank you Maetel!

01:33:56.756 --> 01:33:57.799
What's on your mind?

01:33:59.300 --> 01:34:00.844
We're almost at the
final station, aren't we?

01:34:01.302 --> 01:34:04.222
Is it my imagination, or are you
starting to get depressed?

01:34:05.306 --> 01:34:06.266
That's just it...

01:34:07.559 --> 01:34:08.268
You're imagining it.

01:34:12.605 --> 01:34:13.982
It's Maetel...

01:34:13.982 --> 01:34:16.109
Don't trust Maetel!

01:34:20.196 --> 01:34:23.283
I'm just relieved the journey's
ending without incident, that's all.

01:34:26.619 --> 01:34:27.745
Say, Maetel?

01:34:28.163 --> 01:34:29.455
When this is over...

01:34:29.956 --> 01:34:32.709
What'll you do once
you get back to Earth?

01:34:33.710 --> 01:34:34.961
| have no idea.

01:34:36.129 --> 01:34:36.796
Why?

01:34:43.261 --> 01:34:44.596
If you don't mind, uh--

01:34:45.305 --> 01:34:48.975
I'd, uh, I'd kind of like to
stay with you for a while...

01:35:11.664 --> 01:35:14.042
Tetsuro will understand,
someday.

01:35:15.168 --> 01:35:17.086
He may love me...

01:35:18.046 --> 01:35:22.383
But that love is only a dream,
| left on the other side of time.

01:35:24.385 --> 01:35:28.932
Maetel, you should treasure
your feelings for Tetsuro.

01:35:29.349 --> 01:35:32.143
You mustn't abandon hope,
not until the bitter end.

01:35:37.732 --> 01:35:39.317
Why are you sitting all alone?

01:35:44.489 --> 01:35:48.534
When I sit in an empty car,
it's like I have the train to myself!

01:35:49.869 --> 01:35:51.579
It's a great feeling!

01:36:02.590 --> 01:36:05.426
We thank you for riding
the Galaxy Express!

01:36:06.052 --> 01:36:07.136
So, our next stop is...

01:36:10.765 --> 01:36:12.308
The Final Station, Maetel.

01:36:12.934 --> 01:36:17.563
Planet Maetel,
Mechanization Homeworld.

01:36:28.199 --> 01:36:28.241
Mechanization Homeworld
Planet Maetel

