01:37:58.164 --> 01:37:59.123
Maetel...

01:38:00.541 --> 01:38:04.170
Final Station Maetel.

01:38:05.254 --> 01:38:08.216
Planet Maetel...

01:38:09.717 --> 01:38:13.221
Mechanization Homeworld,
Maetel.

01:38:18.434 --> 01:38:19.018
Why...

01:38:21.104 --> 01:38:23.648
Why does this planet have
the same name as you?

01:38:24.524 --> 01:38:25.817
Why?!

01:38:45.128 --> 01:38:46.963
Welcome home, your highness.

01:38:49.132 --> 01:38:50.341
It's good to see you are well.

01:38:50.925 --> 01:38:54.429
As for this young male
you brought along...

01:38:54.720 --> 01:38:57.890
His courage and strong
sense of responsibility...

01:38:57.890 --> 01:39:00.476
Were immediately logged
by Central Computing.

01:39:01.686 --> 01:39:04.647
Her Majesty is most pleased.

01:39:06.149 --> 01:39:06.732
Maetel!

01:39:07.108 --> 01:39:07.525
What--

01:39:07.525 --> 01:39:08.818
What does this mean?

01:39:09.610 --> 01:39:14.657
Our planet functions solely on
Mechanized human components.

01:39:16.534 --> 01:39:18.786
You have successfully
met all of our criteria...

01:39:19.078 --> 01:39:23.166
Except the fact that you
killed our hero, Count Mecha.

01:39:23.416 --> 01:39:25.585
This is an unpardonable felony.

01:39:26.794 --> 01:39:28.838
As penance for your sin...

01:39:29.380 --> 01:39:32.842
You shall become a Mechanized
component of Planet Maetel...

01:39:32.842 --> 01:39:36.220
Laboring eternally
for its benefit.

01:39:37.930 --> 01:39:38.848
This is a joke!

01:39:39.307 --> 01:39:40.183
Right Maetel?

01:39:49.317 --> 01:39:51.068
You tricked me!

01:40:06.375 --> 01:40:08.211
The royal transport awaits.

01:40:08.586 --> 01:40:09.837
Shall we, your highness?

01:40:36.948 --> 01:40:37.949
Tetsuro!

01:41:34.213 --> 01:41:36.090
Queen Promethium!

01:41:36.090 --> 01:41:40.219
Reporting Part Number:
8-9-9-8-9-8-2.

01:41:40.219 --> 01:41:43.514
Human name: Hoshino Tetsuro,
Your Majesty.

01:41:43.514 --> 01:41:45.391
Very good.

01:41:45.683 --> 01:41:48.644
I'm never becoming
one of your parts!

01:41:53.232 --> 01:41:54.984
What is the suitability
of this young male?

01:41:55.401 --> 01:41:58.154
He will make a fine bolt
for the central block.

01:41:58.529 --> 01:41:59.488
The reason?

01:42:00.364 --> 01:42:01.407
This male has a strong will.

01:42:01.407 --> 01:42:06.037
We feel he will not break or fall out,
even from strong shock.

01:42:06.787 --> 01:42:08.956
You're turning me into a bolt?

01:42:08.956 --> 01:42:11.375
Correct, a living bolt with a soul.

01:42:11.709 --> 01:42:14.211
A component to
support the planet.

01:42:16.380 --> 01:42:16.964
Let me go!

01:42:17.632 --> 01:42:18.799
Back off!

01:42:19.091 --> 01:42:21.427
| said let go, you bastards!

01:42:21.677 --> 01:42:23.721
| don't want to be a bolt!

01:42:24.013 --> 01:42:25.097
Get your mitts off of me!

01:42:25.890 --> 01:42:27.475
That hurts, damn it!

01:42:28.934 --> 01:42:29.810
You jerks!

01:42:31.854 --> 01:42:33.064
Cut it out!

01:42:33.648 --> 01:42:34.940
Stop this!

01:42:35.316 --> 01:42:39.195
I'm not gonna let you
monsters do this to me!

01:42:39.487 --> 01:42:40.863
Let me go!

01:42:51.916 --> 01:42:52.833
What are you doing here?

01:42:53.292 --> 01:42:55.044
You here to gloat or something?

01:42:55.503 --> 01:42:59.965
Watch what you say to my daughter,
or I'll kill you on the spot!

01:43:00.424 --> 01:43:01.050
Daughter?

01:43:01.050 --> 01:43:05.971
Sole daughter of Queen Promethium,
ruler of the Machine Empire.

01:43:07.306 --> 01:43:13.104
So, I traveled with a mechanical
monster and didn't have a clue.

01:43:13.104 --> 01:43:15.231
And to think
| loved that monster...

01:43:15.231 --> 01:43:16.399
unbelievable.

01:43:16.941 --> 01:43:20.569
But Tetsuro,
Maetel loves you too!

01:43:22.905 --> 01:43:24.156
The voice from before?

01:43:24.657 --> 01:43:25.449
Doctor Ban!

01:43:26.242 --> 01:43:27.410
That's right, Mother...

01:43:30.204 --> 01:43:31.163
It's Father!

01:43:31.455 --> 01:43:34.250
The traitor who advocated
the anti-Mechanized world!

01:43:34.959 --> 01:43:38.879
That's right Promethium,
you pathetic Mechanized woman!

01:43:39.255 --> 01:43:43.008
My spirit has been converted
into the energy within this capsule.

01:43:43.008 --> 01:43:46.303
There should be just enough
to destroy the core of this planet...

01:43:46.554 --> 01:43:49.223
And shatter it to pieces!

01:43:49.473 --> 01:43:50.766
How foolish.

01:43:51.142 --> 01:43:54.145
Planet Maetel was made
up of live components.

01:43:54.145 --> 01:43:55.813
It simply can't be destroyed.

01:43:56.021 --> 01:43:58.399
But Maetel acquired
those components for you!

01:43:58.399 --> 01:44:02.153
Holding back her tears,
she led them with a purpose.

01:44:02.570 --> 01:44:04.697
Those comrades all
sacrificed themselves...

01:44:04.697 --> 01:44:09.660
So that they might be
placed in strategic locations!

01:44:11.287 --> 01:44:12.204
Comrades?

01:44:12.621 --> 01:44:17.042
Everyone who came back with me
came to serve the same cause.

01:44:17.752 --> 01:44:19.712
They are all willing to die...

01:44:20.087 --> 01:44:22.965
If it meant the Machine Empire
might be destroyed!

01:44:22.965 --> 01:44:27.762
Sol held back all of my tears,
and brought countless martyrs here!

01:44:29.221 --> 01:44:33.726
Maetel, you would betray me as well?

01:44:33.726 --> 01:44:38.522
The mother who gave you the most
beautiful body in the whole universe?

01:44:42.234 --> 01:44:46.030
And the one who gave
you eternal life...

01:44:48.532 --> 01:44:51.744
What you gave me
was eternal torment!

01:44:52.870 --> 01:44:54.246
Are you mad?

01:44:54.497 --> 01:44:57.792
If you throw that pendant,
the entire planet will be destroyed.

01:44:58.125 --> 01:44:59.877
It will destroy you, as well!

01:45:01.545 --> 01:45:02.087
Watch out!

01:45:09.220 --> 01:45:12.723
If it means ruining the Machine Empire,
| could care less!

01:45:30.491 --> 01:45:36.705
A man must always face danger,
even knowing that he may die.

01:45:38.624 --> 01:45:43.212
He must continue to fight,
despite knowing that he may lose.

01:45:44.421 --> 01:45:46.674
Tetsuro knows that well.

01:45:51.345 --> 01:45:53.931
Tetsuro is not to receive
so much as a scratch.

01:45:53.931 --> 01:45:55.474
Make certain he returns to Earth.

01:45:55.850 --> 01:45:56.517
-Roger!
-Roger!

01:46:09.655 --> 01:46:10.573
Tochiro!

01:46:11.824 --> 01:46:12.867
Emeraldas...

01:46:13.742 --> 01:46:17.872
My body may be gone,
but my spirit lives forever.

01:46:18.205 --> 01:46:21.750
I've become the soul of my
best friend's ship, the Arcadia...

01:46:21.750 --> 01:46:23.627
And I'm off to wander
the Sea of Stars.

01:46:25.629 --> 01:46:27.923
| couldn't have done it
without Tetsuro.

01:46:29.216 --> 01:46:30.759
| know that, Tochiro.

01:46:31.135 --> 01:46:34.138
Tetsuro seems to have
inherited your will...

01:46:34.889 --> 01:46:36.640
So I can't let him die.

01:46:56.201 --> 01:46:57.828
Stop, Maetel.

01:46:57.828 --> 01:46:59.163
Do it, Maetel!

01:46:59.538 --> 01:47:01.790
Hurry, destroy the core
of this planet!

01:47:02.750 --> 01:47:04.919
Maetel, give me that pendant.

01:47:05.252 --> 01:47:08.464
Do you intend to destroy
your mother's dream?

01:47:09.715 --> 01:47:10.633
Please!

01:47:11.342 --> 01:47:13.135
This planet is the other me.

01:47:13.135 --> 01:47:16.388
This planet is my other soul!

01:47:16.764 --> 01:47:18.849
We may be living in different
parts of the universe...

01:47:19.141 --> 01:47:21.602
But they are both a part of me!

01:47:21.602 --> 01:47:21.644
But they are both a part of me!

01:47:21.644 --> 01:47:21.685
But they are both a part of me!

01:47:21.685 --> 01:47:21.727
But they are both a part of me!

01:47:21.727 --> 01:47:21.769
But they are both a part of me!

01:47:21.769 --> 01:47:21.810
But they are both a part of me!

01:47:21.810 --> 01:47:21.852
But they are both a part of me!

01:47:21.852 --> 01:47:21.894
But they are both a part of me!

01:47:21.894 --> 01:47:21.936
But they are both a part of me!

01:47:21.936 --> 01:47:21.977
But they are both a part of me!

01:47:21.977 --> 01:47:22.019
But they are both a part of me!

01:47:22.019 --> 01:47:22.061
But they are both a part of me!

01:47:22.061 --> 01:47:22.102
But they are both a part of me!

01:48:02.101 --> 01:48:04.436
How much longer can the
atrocities of Mechanized people...

01:48:04.436 --> 01:48:06.522
Be allowed to continue, Maetel?

01:48:07.690 --> 01:48:10.150
You don't need me any more.

01:48:10.442 --> 01:48:12.027
You'll be fine on your own!

01:48:12.319 --> 01:48:14.822
Hurry and throw it, Maetel!

01:48:15.698 --> 01:48:16.115
Enough.

01:48:16.740 --> 01:48:18.951
Hand over the pendant, Maetel.

01:48:23.956 --> 01:48:25.541
But I...

01:48:25.541 --> 01:48:26.333
I.oo

01:48:26.917 --> 01:48:28.002
Give it to me!

01:49:25.225 --> 01:49:27.478
Tetsuro, I know you can do it.

01:49:27.895 --> 01:49:30.689
This is what you came to do.

01:49:31.023 --> 01:49:35.027
Throw it, so that once
more life may have value!

01:49:35.027 --> 01:49:38.363
Don't you dare!

01:50:04.556 --> 01:50:06.058
Maetel, we've gotta go!

01:50:15.818 --> 01:50:17.069
What are you doing?

01:50:33.502 --> 01:50:35.003
We're falling apart!

01:50:35.462 --> 01:50:37.756
We can't hold on!

01:50:38.006 --> 01:50:39.883
Our hands!

01:50:39.883 --> 01:50:41.885
Our feet!

01:50:41.885 --> 01:50:44.096
Don't let go!

01:50:44.346 --> 01:50:46.473
Can't hang on...

01:50:46.473 --> 01:50:48.225
Falling apart...

01:52:47.469 --> 01:52:49.054
Your hands are so warm.

01:52:49.054 --> 01:52:50.889
How can you be a machine?

01:52:51.890 --> 01:52:54.768
My body is your mother's,
Tetsuro.

01:52:56.478 --> 01:53:00.148
| am a copy of your
mother in her youth.

01:53:00.148 --> 01:53:02.234
| am a shadow
in the form of a human.

01:53:02.567 --> 01:53:06.822
When my body grows old,
| get a copy of a new body.

01:53:07.114 --> 01:53:09.533
That is how I survive,
and travel through time.

01:53:09.533 --> 01:53:11.576
So that's why you look
so much like my mother...

01:54:03.628 --> 01:54:04.421
Hurry!

01:54:42.459 --> 01:54:43.293
Maetel, hurry!

01:55:55.574 --> 01:55:56.450
Mother!

01:55:57.159 --> 01:55:57.534
| can't...

01:55:57.909 --> 01:55:58.535
breathe...

01:55:59.077 --> 01:56:00.287
I'm taking him with me.

01:56:00.287 --> 01:56:02.664
This is your fault, Maetel.

01:56:02.664 --> 01:56:03.623
My fault?

01:56:04.624 --> 01:56:10.172
You betrayed your mother
and deprived her of everything.

01:56:10.755 --> 01:56:14.509
Now I shall deprive you
of your precious Tetsuro!

01:56:15.302 --> 01:56:16.261
Mother...

01:56:16.928 --> 01:56:18.346
Can't... breathe...

01:56:18.889 --> 01:56:20.056
Stop!

01:56:20.432 --> 01:56:24.561
My only wish is to see you
live out your life in sorrow...

01:56:26.354 --> 01:56:30.192
Mother!

01:56:30.525 --> 01:56:32.194
Mother!

01:56:34.654 --> 01:56:35.447
What are you doing?

01:56:35.864 --> 01:56:36.865
Release me!

01:56:38.867 --> 01:56:40.911
Goodbye, Tetsuro!

01:56:44.039 --> 01:56:46.708
My one and only friend...

01:56:53.507 --> 01:56:54.382
| loved you!

01:58:15.463 --> 01:58:17.549
This is all that
remains of Claire...

01:58:17.799 --> 01:58:20.552
Who died so you might live.

01:58:36.401 --> 01:58:39.571
I've never seen
a glass tear before...

01:58:39.571 --> 01:58:43.366
That just might
be Claire's heart.

01:58:51.374 --> 01:58:52.250
Claire...

01:59:10.644 --> 01:59:11.394
Tetsuro.

01:59:14.814 --> 01:59:18.151
May we meet again someday
in the Sea of Stars.

02:00:13.415 --> 02:00:15.417
Farewell, Captain Harlock.

02:00:16.543 --> 02:00:18.378
Farewell, Queen Emeraldas.

02:00:50.368 --> 02:00:51.661
Do you really have to go...?

02:00:52.328 --> 02:00:56.040
| am a woman who has
travelled through time...

02:00:56.875 --> 02:01:00.003
But I must now return
to my original body.

02:01:00.503 --> 02:01:02.756
So, you're off to Pluto.

02:01:05.216 --> 02:01:07.135
I'll be waiting for you...

02:01:12.557 --> 02:01:14.434
Won't we ever meet again?

02:01:16.728 --> 02:01:20.273
But when I return,
you won't know who I am.

02:01:20.940 --> 02:01:23.234
You'll never recognize me again.

02:01:47.383 --> 02:01:50.929
| will be a woman who lives on
only in your memories.

02:01:53.264 --> 02:01:57.185
| will be nothing more than
an illusion of your young heart.

02:01:57.644 --> 02:01:59.062
A phantom of your youth.

02:02:59.497 --> 02:03:02.542
Maetel!

02:03:19.517 --> 02:03:21.436
Maetel!

02:03:26.566 --> 02:03:27.275
Tetsuro.

02:03:29.444 --> 02:03:30.570
Maetel!

02:03:33.573 --> 02:03:34.449
Maetel!

02:03:39.996 --> 02:03:42.457
Maetel!

02:03:46.085 --> 02:03:47.003
Maetel!

02:03:49.923 --> 02:03:52.926
Maetel!

02:04:03.353 --> 02:04:07.690
Maetel!

02:04:14.280 --> 02:04:19.160
Now carrying a thousand thoughts
the whistle blows once more.

02:04:20.078 --> 02:04:24.999
Now carrying a thousand thoughts
the train departs once more.

02:04:26.209 --> 02:04:32.048
As one journey ends,
a new one is about to begin.

02:04:32.840 --> 02:04:34.676
Farewell, Maetel.

02:04:35.802 --> 02:04:39.055
Farewell, Galaxy Express 999.

02:04:48.606 --> 02:04:51.818
Farewell, days of youth.

02:05:18.803 --> 02:05:25.518
Now go!
Lift your face up

02:05:26.269 --> 02:05:32.316
And wash your heart off
with the new wind

02:05:32.650 --> 02:05:39.532
Leave your old dreams behind

02:05:39.824 --> 02:05:45.872
For the sake of the
drama beginning anew

02:05:46.330 --> 02:05:53.129
She has already
become a memory

02:05:53.129 --> 02:06:01.220
<i>But she's gazing
at you from afar</i>

02:06:02.638 --> 02:06:06.809
The Galaxy Express 999
will take you on a journey

02:06:06.809 --> 02:06:09.145
A never-ending journey

02:06:09.645 --> 02:06:12.732
A journey to the stars

02:06:18.863 --> 02:06:25.703
Yes, you have realized

02:06:26.204 --> 02:06:32.251
More wonderful things
than tranquility

02:06:32.251 --> 02:06:39.217
To the disappearing eyes
on the horizon

02:06:39.717 --> 02:06:45.848
Before you realize it,
the light of a man becomes dazzling

02:06:46.307 --> 02:06:52.897
Her eyes were nodding

02:06:52.897 --> 02:07:01.155
That farewells
are one part of love

